Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:07.98,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:08.73,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:09.40,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:10.23,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.03,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:11.78,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:12.40,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.36,OP,,0,0,0,,噗{\3c&HE989DE&}妮{\3c&HED39FC&}露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.86,OP,,0,0,0,,终究{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:16.32,OP,,0,0,0,,表现出{\3c&HE989DE&}一{\3c&HED39FC&}脸遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.91,OP,,0,0,0,,IDE{\3c&HE989DE&}NT{\3c&HED39FC&}ITY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:19.49,OP,,0,0,0,,全都没有{\3c&HE989DE&}啦{\3c&HED39FC&}（对对对）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:20.95,OP,,0,0,0,,假{\3c&HE989DE&}货真{\3c&HED39FC&}货
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.54,OP,,0,0,0,,都分{\3c&HE989DE&}不{\3c&HED39FC&}清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.08,OP,,0,0,0,,窟窿e{\3c&HE989DE&}y{\3c&HED39FC&}e eye
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.04,OP,,0,0,0,,快{\3c&HE989DE&}说拜{\3c&HED39FC&}拜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:28.46,OP,,0,0,0,,本能！烦恼{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}战斗就惨败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.63,OP,,0,0,0,,Watch out！夺取别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}个性的家伙决不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:34.76,OP,,0,0,0,,那就用不一般的{\3c&HE989DE&}方{\3c&HED39FC&}式来招待  AW！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:38.01,OP,,0,0,0,,Perfect！将百亿满{\3c&HE989DE&}分{\3c&HED39FC&}的KAWAII送给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.97,OP,,0,0,0,,成为别{\3c&HE989DE&}人{\3c&HED39FC&}的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:43.81,OP,,0,0,0,,想？还{\3c&HE989DE&}是{\3c&HED39FC&}不想？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:50.19,OP,,0,0,0,,分离四散{\3c&HE989DE&}的{\3c&HED39FC&}细胞们呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.65,OP,,0,0,0,,再度集合（R{\3c&HE989DE&}ea{\3c&HED39FC&}dy GO！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.15,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:54.61,OP,,0,0,0,,别混{\3c&HE989DE&}入{\3c&HED39FC&}其中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:56.20,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.70,OP,,0,0,0,,就这{\3c&HE989DE&}样{\3c&HED39FC&}伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.24,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.83,OP,,0,0,0,,超越{\3c&HE989DE&}条条{\3c&HED39FC&}框框
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.45,OP,,0,0,0,,展{\3c&HE989DE&}露出{\3c&HED39FC&}来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.21,OP,,0,0,0,,任{\3c&HE989DE&}其飞{\3c&HED39FC&}翔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.66,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:07.25,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:10.34,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HED39FC&}不要妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.84,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Br{\3c&HE989DE&}un  {\3c&HED39FC&}奔跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:13.38,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-B{\3c&HE989DE&}ru{\3c&HED39FC&}n  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.51,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun-Brun  {\3c&HE989DE&}想{\3c&HED39FC&}一直在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.64,OP,,0,0,0,,抓紧时间 {\3c&HE989DE&}去{\3c&HED39FC&}你身边…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.18,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:23.14,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:26.73,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.23,OP,,0,0,0,,Brun{\3c&HE989DE&}-{\3c&HED39FC&}Brun
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,==========ED===========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.33,0:22:29.83,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}凉爽的风吹过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:32.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}那蓝天的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:37.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}今天就悠闲地度过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:40.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}风铃响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:42.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}向日葵的黄色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:47.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}和我没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:51.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}原本是这么以为的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:56.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}夏日来到  看见了起点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:23:01.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}“受伤累了”也没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:06.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}下次恋情会走向何方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.83,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}这不是电影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.83,0:23:11.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}主角是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.49,0:23:14.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}这不是电影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:16.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}轮到我们了
